# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Split-out directories
#
# `main` carries only what a self-hoster needs: facilitator, mcp-server,
# packages, deploy. Everything below lives on the `full-stack` branch:
#
#   git checkout full-stack
#
#   brand/      brand kit and assets (also on `assets/brandkit`)
#   frontend/   Next.js explorer dashboard — not required to self-host
#   tasks/      internal working notes
#   reference/  external repo clones used while developing (~7.6 GB)
#
# These stay on disk when you switch back to `main`; they are simply untracked
# here. Nothing in facilitator/ or mcp-server/ imports them, and none of them
# are npm workspaces.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/brand/
/frontend/
/tasks/
/reference/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Dependencies / build output
node_modules/
dist/
target/
.next/

# Local environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Example apps pull their own dependencies
/examples/*/node_modules/
